1. GRANT OF LICENSE
uvcpipe is distributed under two tiers:
(a) Free Core Tier: device probing (probe), emergency HID release
    (release-all / restore), --dry-run HID packet previews, --describe,
    --help, and --version.
(b) Commercial Pro Tier (Valid license.json Required): HDMI frame capture
    (capture), localhost live MJPEG viewer (view), live CH9329 serial HID
    writes (key, type, mouse), and the stdio MCP server (mcp). Open-source
    builds compiled with -DOSS_EDITION unlock all capabilities offline.

